      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Itungījo lya mpungatī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho walītaligūla ī litungījo lya mpungatī hūbiza sele sele ū ng'wigūlū, ikanza gītī lya nusu sa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bamalaika mpungatī abo baalī bīmīīla kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu, nūbabona binhwa mapembe mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na malaika ūngī wiza wīmīīla ha ng'walīlo; walī winhwa ngazu ningī mu shinje ya zahabu, gīkī azuukīje hamò na būlombi wa beela bose, a ha ng'walīlo gwa zahabu ūyo gwalī kū būtongi wī Isumbi lya būtemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī lyochi lya ngazu nū būlombi wa beela bose, shūfuma ū mu nkono go ng'wa malaika ng'wenūyo, shilīdundumūka shilinhile kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū malaika wīsola ī shinje ūyokaja makala ga moto kūfuma a ha ng'walīlo henaho, ūgūponeja mu sī; shūbiza ho būpalalūki na mihilimo na ndabi na nyahīnga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūng'ang'aajiwa kwa mapembe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bamalaika mpungatī abo baalī na mapembe, bibeeja beeja gīkī bandye kūgang'ang'aaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū wa kwandya ūlīng'ang'aaja ī lipembe lyakwe; yūgwa a ha sī mbula ya mawe, na moto gūsangīlīgije na mininga; selusi īmò ya sī yūbakīla, na selusi īmò ya mitī yūjiga, na a maswa a madoto gūjiga pye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū malaika wa kabīlī ūlīng'ang'aaja ī lipembe lyakwe; līshikolo itaale lya kūbiza gītī lūgūlū lyūponejiwa mu nyanza līkūbakaga moto. Selusi īmò ya minzī ga mu nyanza yūgalūka kūbiza mininga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna selusi īmò ya shiseeng'wa ī sha mu nyanza īsho shilī na būpanga shūshila kūcha, na selusi īmò ya meli jūkenaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū malaika wa kadatū ūlīng'ang'aaja ī lipembe lyakwe; yika Sonda kūfuma ng'wigūlū īlībaka moto gītī līchenge itaale. Yūgwīla ha selusi īmò ya myongo, nī nzwīlo ja minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lina lyayo ī Sonda yenīyo īkitanagwa Būlūlū. Selusi īmò ya minzī gūlūla; banhū bingī būshila kūcha kūlwa nguno ya būlūlū bo minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū malaika wa kane ūlīng'ang'aaja ī lipembe lyakwe; selusi īmò ya līīmi yūtūlwa, na selusi īmò ya ng'weji, na selusi īmò ya sonda ī jose. Selusi īmò ya shose īshi yūbiza mu giiti; hū kūhaya selusi īmò ya makanza ga līīmi yūbiza mu giiti; na a makanza a ga būjikū naho gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla nabona mbeshi īlīlala ng'wigūlya, nūyigwa īlīhamuka n'ilaka itaale īlīhaya gīkī, “Bagwīlwa makoye, bagwīlwa makoye a banhū abo balī mu sī kūlwa nguno ya malaka ga mapembe ga bamalaika a badatū, ayo gashiiga ū kūng'ang'aajiwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
